# City Temperature API

## Description

FastAPI application for managing cities and temperature history.

## Technologies

- FastAPI
- SQLAlchemy
- SQLite
- Pydantic
- httpx

## Installation

pip install -r requirements.txt

## Run

uvicorn main:app --reload

## API

POST /cities

GET /cities

PUT /cities/{id}

DELETE /cities/{id}

POST /temperatures/update

GET /temperatures

GET /temperatures?city_id=1

## Design

- SQLite is used as the database.
- SQLAlchemy ORM manages database access.
- Weather data is fetched asynchronously using httpx.
- Dependency injection is implemented using FastAPI Depends.

## Assumptions

- WeatherAPI is used as the temperature provider.
- Temperature history is stored permanently.